From: PrusaSlicer profile-sync fork
Subject: [PATCH] win32: do not pop up a console window for spawned processes

libgit2 exec SSH transport spawns ssh.exe; from a GUI app that flashes an
empty console window per fetch/push. Its stdio is piped, so create the child
without a console.

--- a/src/util/win32/process.c	2025-06-06 09:26:15
+++ b/src/util/win32/process.c
@@ -254,7 +254,7 @@
 {
 	STARTUPINFOW startup_info;
 	SECURITY_ATTRIBUTES security_attrs;
-	DWORD flags = CREATE_UNICODE_ENVIRONMENT;
+	DWORD flags = CREATE_UNICODE_ENVIRONMENT | CREATE_NO_WINDOW;
 	HANDLE in[2]  = { NULL, NULL },
 	       out[2] = { NULL, NULL },
 	       err[2] = { NULL, NULL };
